@startuml F7.4-D01-listar-tipos-solicitacao
title F7.4-D01 — Listar tipos e carregar editor
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RTController" as Ctrl
participant "ListRTUseCase" as ListUC
participant "GetRTUseCase" as GetUC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: /admin/tipos-solicitacao
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /request-types
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> ListUC: execute(...)
ListUC -> Postgres: SELECT tipos
Postgres --> WebApp: 200 lista
Admin -> WebApp: seleciona tipo
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /request-types/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> GetUC: execute(...)
GetUC -> Postgres: SELECT schemas
Postgres --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Admin: três painéis

@enduml
